::callout{title="Need every meal labeled?"}
CaterCow delivers Italian catering from local restaurants, including [individually boxed pasta meals](https://www.catercow.com/dishes/individually-packaged-italian-and-pasta) labeled with each guest's name and dietary needs. Your first order of $100 or more also earns a [$100 Olive Garden gift card](https://www.catercow.com/blog/8-olive-garden-catering-promo-codes).
::

